  "limitations": [
    "All inputs are synthetic; no host SDK, socket, phone, device or RF execution.",
    "Angle model constructor/serialization/deserialization, complete GetRotateAnglePack, Buffer and V1 encoder execute.",
    "Reset, photo, record and work-mode use explicit producer windows after upper-layer type/cache/state admission; no complete SDK action lifecycle is claimed.",
    "Only two model vtable GOT relocations are installed in key-value; those vtables are not dispatched.",
    "Constructor receiver index0 and sourceAPP2 are verified, but Neo2 runtime abstraction choice and firmware support are unproven.",
    "Pitch mechanical range, duration unit, upper-action joint reference and camera recording-time unit are unproven.",
    "ActionRotateAngle uses SendPack with an empty callback and enqueue completion; no application ACK parser for04/14 is established.",
    "Other actual response callbacks and raw byte0 getters execute to error-mapping/completion observation boundaries. The separately executed native mapper maps only raw0 to success; publication is not executed.",
    "Null response and native empty Buffer complete\u221211. Contrived zero-length/non-null Buffer cases expose missing getter length checks, not valid empty-wire ACK acceptance.",
    "Sequence is supplied to the encoder. Core request matching, outer WiFi51/01 wrapping, firmware acceptance, motion and file persistence are outside this probe.",
    "Status getter leaves execute to value-construction/publication boundaries; no real push, causal action-to-status correlation or device identity is included.",
    "CameraWorkMode0/1 names are static Java joins; mode-switch-before-action policy and waiting for a fresh matching push are PC choices, not a proven firmware requirement."
  ]
